>I have found the Wizard of Yendor, killed him, and found the Book of the Dead.
>But I found no Amulet of Yendor. Doesn't he carry it around with him? I've 
>searched and searched throughout the level, but cannot find it. Is it to be 
>found elsewhere? Help please.

	No, in version 3.1.x the wizard does not carry the Amulet about with
him.  You will need the Bell, Book, and Candelabrum to get the Amulet.

>Also:
