>but each time I got a candle. Can't I get the candelabrum by wish? Or does
>this mean it already exists in the dungeon? If so, where would it be? I'm
>tired of searching maze after maze!

	On one of the levels you might (should) have noticed _two_ sets of
staircases leading up.  One leads back to the castle, the other to the tower
of Vlad the Impaler, who holds the Candelabrum.

>Oh, and what is the difference between tallow and wax candles from the
>candelabrum point of view? Which should I use when (and if) I find the
>candelabrum?

	The only difference is that one lasts longer than the other.  You will
need seven candles for the Candelabrum, so use whichever type of which you
have more than that.

